        "original_id": "9f686561-abc0-563b-8217-35c700b243c7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mack Brown\n- Organizations: Texas Longhorns football, Iowa State Cyclones football, Kansas State Wildcats football, ESPN\n- Places: Darrell K Royal–Texas Memorial Stadium, Manhattan, Kansas\n- Events: 2011 Texas Longhorns football team season, 2011 Iowa State Cyclones football team season, Farmageddon series\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2011 season, the Texas Longhorns football team was led by head coach Mack Brown in his 14th year and played its home games at Darrell K Royal–Texas Memorial Stadium.\n- In the 2011 season, the Iowa State Cyclones football team began conference play with a home loss to the Texas Longhorns football team.\n- In the 2011 season, the Iowa State Cyclones football team ended conference play with a loss to the Kansas State Wildcats football team in Manhattan, Kansas, in the Farmageddon series, finishing with a 3–6 conference record.\n- Mack Brown is a college football commentator for ESPN.",
